Subject: [PATCH] Add instance-owned authored feedback with bounded native detail

Default off; Standard runs only the authored warp. Medium/High retain a centered,
headroom-limited native band without unsigned storage bias. Each preset owns its
canvas/resources; unsupported canvases or shaders keep patch 0038 fallback.

